---
description: Commit message policy — Conventional Commits, no AI co-authors
alwaysApply: true
---

# Commits

- Only commit when the user explicitly asks
- Format: `type(scope): summary` (see `docs/agent/COMMIT_CONVENTION.md`)
- **Never** add `Co-Authored-By`, `Generated-By`, or AI `Signed-off-by`
- Validate with `./scripts/agent/check-commit-msg.sh`
- Do not pass `--no-gpg-sign` / `--no-verify` unless the user requests it
